    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Le petit village d\u2019Espigoule tourne une page de son histoire. Jean-Marc, jeune retrait\u00e9, a vendu son bistrot. Apr\u00e8s bien des h\u00e9sitations, il finit par accepter de partir en vacances au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal avec son ami Momo. Loin de leurs fronti\u00e8res varoises, ils feront la rencontre de Modou, un S\u00e9n\u00e9galais plut\u00f4t filou charg\u00e9 de leur faire d\u00e9couvrir le pays. Malgr\u00e9 les d\u00e9buts difficiles des pigeons occidentaux, des gal\u00e8res en tout genre, des j\u00e9r\u00e9miades de Jean-Marc pas habitu\u00e9 \u00e0 si peu de confort, une v\u00e9ritable amiti\u00e9 va se nouer.",
        "english": "The small village of Espigoule turns a page of its history. Jean-Marc, newly retired, has sold his bar. After many hesitations, he finally accepts to go on vacation in Senegal with his friend Momo. Far from their Var borders in southern France, they encounter Modou, a Senegalese man with a knack for swindling, responsible for showing them around the country. Despite a difficult start for these Western suckers, every kind of mishap, and Jean-Marc's whining about the lack of comfort, a real friendship forms."
